{
  "version": 1,
  "name": "uze nerd",
  "description": "UZE's marks drawn in Codicons, the icon set VS Code draws its own chrome with. Needs a Nerd Fonts v3 patched font, where Codicons live at U+EA60-EC84; transcribed from the official glyphnames.json (Nerd Fonts 3.5.1) by name, never by codepoint. Widths are declared for the `Nerd Font Mono` builds, whose icons occupy one cell; on a non-Mono build they occupy two, and unicode-width cannot tell the two apart. Declares symbols only, and only the ones an icon says better than a letterform: box drawing, bars and typography are the built-in default's, which any patched font draws.",
